  (text "BMS 1-4S Li-ion + USB-C PD (DRP) + output terminal 1-16V\n\nAlur daya:\n  USB-C -> TPS25750D (PD) -> VBUS_SYS -> BQ25713 (buck-boost) -> VSYS\n  VSYS <-> BATFET <-> PACK_P <-> BQ40Z50 (FET proteksi) <-> cell 1-4S\n  VSYS -> TPS55289 -> terminal 1-16V (DIP 4 bit + tombol APPLY)\n  VSYS -> NCP718 -> +3V3 (MCU STM32G031, TPS25750)\n  OTG: BQ25713 -> VBUS_SYS -> TPS25750 -> USB-C (PD source)\n\nBus I2C MCU: BQ25713 0x6B | BQ40Z50 0x0B | TPS55289 0x74 | TPS25750 0x20\nBus I2C TPS25750 (terpisah): EEPROM 24LC256 0x50\n\nStatus: DRAFT v0.1 - lihat README.md bagian VERIFIKASI sebelum layout PCB." (at 30.48 182.88 0)
